{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S02、S04等段落的感受提示切分得较细，连续出现时容易让注意力在叙事和意象之间来回跳，局部略显拥挤。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过放大加亮心理转折的关键词，让观众能迅速抓住每段发生了什么，再通过小字和随音乐出现的感受补足当下的情绪与声音质地。更重要的是，Y把从害怕给对方负担、发现对方没有退开，到渴望互相依靠、害怕失去、最终不再隐藏心意的心理变化交代得更细，前后因果也更清楚；X的句子虽然流畅完整，但关键心理节点不够突出，音乐感受也相对概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "43d10dc5-ca8a-46b3-ae14-efe42a90e249", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010545493088Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:07:18.348412+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c96fceebe267436ffb9de8a1a773ff7543b43b90446acf0b47473548b44dc847", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e